// A gen_statem's state functions are where its own code starts running,
// the same as a GenServer's callbacks. The points-to stage
// (points_to.dl) includes this file, so self() and a statem's data
// resolve through them; an analysis that reads the staged points-to
// includes it too, so the process_entry it asks agrees with the one the
// stage resolved with. statem_event_clause is an input, and the pins
// record what each analysis reads.
//
// Requires otp.dl (the stage: callbacks.dl).

process_entry(mod, f) :- statem_event_clause(mod, f, _).
